          "key": "L36bc11c52f",
          "source": "Your chop keeps ringing. What fixes it?"
        },
        {
          "key": "L1d69290ad4",
          "source": "Strum harder"
        },
        {
          "key": "L3a752d4d53",
          "source": "Lift your fingers off the neck"
        },
        {
          "key": "L874480fb33",
          "source": "Ease off with your fretting fingers sooner"
        },
        {
          "key": "Lf2b380c306",
          "source": "The chop is choked by the fretting hand. Relax the pressure but keep your fingertips on the strings."
        }
      ]
    }
