          "source": "In a round, the second player…"
        },
        {
          "key": "Lb8c57d789d",
          "source": "Plays a different tune"
        },
        {
          "key": "L8e6d99d6d5",
          "source": "Starts the same tune later"
        },
        {
          "key": "Lcbabe9b78f",
          "source": "Plays the tune backward"
        },
        {
          "key": "Lbf0980ae76",
          "source": "Everyone plays the same melody, each starting a little later. The phrases are built to fit on top of each other."
