          "key": "Ledaa004ffe",
          "source": "Why does it matter that no pair rings open?"
        },
        {
          "key": "L26e72d036e",
          "source": "It makes the chord louder"
        },
        {
          "key": "L47cc289fbf",
          "source": "You can silence it by easing off"
